<title>ITALY: SOCCER-INTER BEAT ANDERLECHT IN UEFA CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-INTER BEAT ANDERLECHT IN UEFA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inter of Italy beat Anderlecht of Belgium 2-1 in their UEFA Cup quarter-final second leg match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Inter - Maurizio Ganz 12 and 60</p>
<p>Anderlecht - Yaw Preko 33</p>
<p>Aggregate score: Inter won 3-2</p>
<p>Attendance: 34,221.</p>
</text>
